  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On their first morning teamed up together, Ono takes Muranishi straight to a movie theater instead of visiting customers. When Muranishi anxiously asks about work, Ono hands him a novel about a seagull and talks about freedom. Listen to their whispered conversation in the dark cinema.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "小野さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "正気か？お前。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "今から一番面白いパートだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "見せ場だよ、見せ場！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "確かにそうみたいですけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "セールスにはいつ行くんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "気が向いたらに決まってるだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "君は真の自分に立ち返る自由を得たのだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "助言ですか？ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "ジョナサンの一節だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "空でやれることは何か知りたいだけなんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ただそれだけのことさ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even inside a dark theater, Muranishi worries about schedules while Ono quotes literature. Let's look closer at each line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "今から一番面白いパートだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The most exciting part is starting right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "見せ場だよ、見せ場！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is the best scene, the highlight!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "確かにそうみたいですけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, it certainly looks that way, though.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "セールスにはいつ行くんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When are we going out to do sales?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "気が向いたらに決まってるだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whenever I feel like it, obviously.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "君は真の自分に立ち返る自由を得たのだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have gained the freedom to return to your true self.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "助言ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that advice?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "ジョナサンの一節だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is a passage from Jonathan.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "空でやれることは何か知りたいだけなんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just want to know what I can do in the sky.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ただそれだけのことさ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is all there is to it.'",
      "gap": 0.9
